        <Label Content="Hi, my name is Peter Parker, and you don't remember me, but I have something to tell you that's going to sound crazy. But it's the truth, and I know you're going to believe me, because you're very good at telling when I'm lying.&#xD;&#xA;We used to know each other. We were together.&#xD;&#xA;But something bad was going to happen to the world. And the only way to stop it was to make everyone forget me, including you.&#xD;&#xA;Because I'm not just Peter Parker. I'm Spider-Man.&#xD;&#xA;And sometimes, Spider-Man has to do the hard thing. Even if it breaks Peter Parker's heart.&#xD;&#xA;Maybe I'll never read this to you. Maybe I'm just writing this for me. Maybe that's my responsibility, to live alone with the truth.&#xD;&#xA;But the truth is I love you. And I hope that deep down, something inside you remembers you love me too.&quot;" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Height="248" Margin="16,152,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Top" Width="1133" FontSize="20" FontWeight="Bold" Background="#FFC50202"/>

